;    0: TWdLink(count=3628, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ヘリ荒田.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "600" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\朝日.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―Bright light hits my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And from far away, the sound of a helicopter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, right. They've finally come to get us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That optimistic thought was the first thing that came to me.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
But there are sights that can destroy a mood like that in a matter of seconds.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\切ないストリングスが印象的な感動BGM.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\朝日.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "環境音\crows.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The scene that was so hard to see in the night is laid out vividly by the sunlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the cries of crows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cawing and flapping wings, so many I can't even tell how many dozens there are.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\カラス.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The crows are swarming over the spot where <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> has fallen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The crows are pecking at <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>'s body.<PG>
Meanwhile, only a few of them are pecking lightly at <STYLE ID="2">another body</STYLE>, as if testing it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lump of flesh of a small, cute girl I recognize.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Dammit! Get away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>'s lookalike, that lump of flesh, has crows swarming it. I chase them off, then throw stones at the flock crowding the place where <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a moment the crows scatter, but they soon go right back to <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>'s spot.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\カラス飛んでいく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As I keep up this fight, the crows fly off little by little, until only <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>'s and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>'s remains and I are left behind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>'s body has been ravaged until the bones of her whole body are exposed, and the only thing proving it was <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> is her blood-<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE> clothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>'s body doesn't look like it's been eaten yet.<PG>
The crows' beaks are <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE> with blood, and they flap away carrying little red things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like a sky burial, a great many crows turned <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="もうきん">birds of prey</STYLE> return <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>'s flesh to the heavens.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\秘密基地内部月光なし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Inside the cave, still dim, <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> has breathed her last.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably attacked the same way as <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> is nowhere to be seen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE>'s story was that <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> really had been dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, reborn as a divine messenger, she appeared in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was supposedly meant to become the faithful servant of this Goddess thing.<PG>
Where did <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> go?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was she cast off by the Goddess for trying to save us, or did she become the Goddess's servant for real this time?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't say which is true, but there's one strange thing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\朝日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It's that I'm calmly looking at this scene I can't accept, without falling apart at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why am I able to stay this calm?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> both died, didn't they?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> even got eaten by crows, didn't she?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How can I stay this calm?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> came here only half a day ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've been all alone this whole time, and now I'm just alone again, that's all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Have I gotten too used to being alone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or was it that I got to see the end of <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, who I thought I might never meet again, and that let me make peace with it?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There was no sign of anyone in the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I checked inside the houses, but there was no one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To be precise... there were no people, but there were <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE> in human shape.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Familiar-looking <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE> lay inside the houses, lifeless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, Shirozaki-san, all of them had become <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE>.<PG>
It's not like I can tell an ordinary corpse from an <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryo</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But unlike <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>'s and <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>'s bodies, I sensed a strange pulsing and breath from the villagers' bodies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They should have been dead, and yet it was as if something were squirming inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A stench of life, far too vivid to call them dead, hung in the air.<PG>
Will they really turn into cherry trees like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that probably won't happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People from outside are approaching this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They'll probably be carried down the mountain by human hands and dissected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And this parasitic cherry will become known to humankind.<PG>
If I stay in the settlement like this, I'm sure they'll take me in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even if they do take me in, where am I supposed to go?<PG>
Even if I go back to Motoki-cho, there's no one I know there anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the Arata settlement, there aren't even any people left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never want to set foot in Megasawa City again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no place for me to belong in the outside world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So―
{PAUSE ""}
the place to belong that's left to me is―<PG>
No, but before that, there's something I have to do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the Niimura house's kitchen, I found something that would do.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神首つり.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "L" "T" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the end, when the Verde mummy first appeared, who was it that <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="つ">strung</STYLE> this one up?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who was it that hit me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they hit me with only enough force not to knock me out, then―
{PAUSE ""}
Haha... I see...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> was desperate to make this place look dangerous, so I'd get out of here quickly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, if I'd wanted to, I could have escaped the Arata settlement anytime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I worried about the settlement, feared for <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, and stayed here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> took matters into her own hands to try to save us.<PG>
Then she should've just told me so from the start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or did <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> have some reason she couldn't tell me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For example, maybe she was being watched by <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> or this so-called Goddess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, there's no way to find out now.<PG>
Goodbye, Lady Verde.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because of you, I've had a terrible time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... none of it was your fault, was it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You just didn't want to hurt people, so you gouged out your eye, and then you died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And for it to turn into something this twisted... your soul can't rest, can it?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\サクラミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm sure <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE> ended up the way <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> did.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just like <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> went strange at first, <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE> went strange too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyone with precognition ends up cursed by the Verde mummy, as a matter of course.<PG>
A year ago, <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE> probably told everyone to use Droga or something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As a result, all the villagers went strange from the Droga and the Verde mummy, caused a horror like last night's, and turned into <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason it didn't seem to work on <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>, but in the end, the only difference for <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> was whether she became an <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryo</STYLE> or food for crows.<PG>
I strike a match and toss it onto the tatami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\火事.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "炎.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
The fire spreads to the two mummies, and that stench starts to drift from <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I thought, this smell is falsificaso.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who rigged <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s mummy to cause trouble when it was set on fire must have been <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> had been watching over me for 2 years, struggling all alone, without anyone's help.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I hurry out of the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound of the helicopter I'd been hearing in the distance grows louder little by little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they see me, it'll be a hassle.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜散る.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just as <STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE> prophesied, the Arata settlement has perished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And whether the 'something that comes from outside' she feared is what destroyed the Arata settlement, I don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the humans' standpoint, it probably has perished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the Arata cherry's standpoint, it probably defended it to the end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But either way, the Arata cherry will probably perish.<PG>
Because soon a whole crowd of the almighty humans will arrive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even I can predict that the outsiders will carry off every last one of the new <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はい">embryos</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Couldn't the Arata cherry foresee this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What would <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> say?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"For plants, once they've borne seeds, it's mission complete!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Whether the seeds actually sprout is up to the descendants left behind to manage on their own!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's probably what she'd say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Humans look after their kids until they grow up, so maybe we win on that point.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking about that, I try to find any point at all where humans come out ahead.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
What could I have done to save everyone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In these 24 hours, there must have been plenty of clues.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These should all <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="つな">connect</STYLE> to every event.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everything I didn't understand or couldn't explain until now should all connect to what happened in these 24 hours.<PG>
Thinking about that now... won't do any good...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
More than that... I have to think about what I'm going to do from now on.<PG>
A place where I can be, where on earth―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲を乗り継ぐ冒険.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
